{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-35620","model_call":25,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" students (+ engineers doctors scientists professionals careers) (+ calculus college future))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" students (+ engineers doctors scientists professionals careers) (+ calculus college future))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_638824153#4_1349656986","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2143","rank":1,"snippet":"\"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_638824153#4_1349656986\" , \"end_char\": 3047.000000 , \"headings\": \"Jaime Escalante Biography, Life, Interesting Facts Jaime Escalante Also Known For : Teacher Birth Place : La Paz, Bolivia Died On : March 30, 2010 Zodiac Sign : Capricorn<cover>Jaime Escalante Biography, Life, Interesting Facts Early life and education Development of career Calculus class Recognition Further work Later life \" , \"segment\": \"Precisely at the same time, the accreditation of the school was questioned, but Jame Escalante did not agree to lower the standards for his students to save the school. He did precisely the opposite – he raised the rules, which forced students to study more and with a higher sense of responsibility. He offered his students a perspective of good jobs and careers </cover>if they paid enough attention to his subject – maths. The perspective fields he provided were electronics, computers, engineering and some others. Jaime Escalante's initiative in the school was not welcomed too openly, until the change of the principal in the school. As soon as Henry Gradillas started working as the principal, he motivated Escalante to "},"time":90},"model_calls":25,"document_judgments":17,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
