{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-35620","model_call":86,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2193"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q2193"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#4_1878648617","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2193","rank":2,"snippet":"\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#4_1878648617\" , \"end_char\": 3114.000000 , \"headings\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Obituaries Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Students 'Stand And Deliver' For Former Teacher 'Barrio Kids' Web Resources After-Hours Tutoring Giving Back To 'Kimo' Fund public radio's <cover>future \" , \"segment\": \"You have to love the subject you teach. And you have to love the kids and make them see that they have a chance, opportunity, in this country to become whatever they want to. SANCHEZ: And to make it, Escalante often said, you need ganas, Spanish for desire and drive. Ganas was Escalante's battle cry, not just in motivating his students </cover>but every time he chided apathetic administrators and jaded teachers. The movie \"Stand and Deliver\" captures the tension perfectly in this scene, when Escalante, played by Edward James Olmos, makes an announcement at a faculty meeting. (SOUNDBITE OF MOVIE, \"STAND AND DELIVER\") EDWARD JAMES OLMOS: Unidentified Woman (Actor): ( As character) That's ridicules. Our kids can't handle calculus.\" , \"start_char\""},"time":9},"model_calls":86,"document_judgments":48,"relevance_3":10,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
